From 60cce77a61d972d83fca4cb3fbebc02dcba6cd22 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: soaresden <soaresden@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 23:27:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/8] dispatch: play Nokia ringing tones through the MIDI
 synthesizer

MIDP-1.0 games on S60v1 give their com.nokia.mid.sound.Sound tones to the
audio player as Nokia Smart Messaging ringing tones. No host decoder reads
that format, so opening the player fails and KMidRun stops the game with
"Memory full" or a KERN-EXEC 3 panic (Gameloft's Siberian Strike, Bubble
Bash, Prince of Persia: The Sands of Time).

Convert a supplied buffer that starts with a ringing tone command to a
Standard MIDI File and open it with the configured MIDI backend.
---
